show-in-antofagasta\">Trans-Tasman collaboration on show in Antofagasta</a></h4>\n        <p>A week-long programme of engagements in Antofagasta, northern Chile (8\u201312 June 2026), highlighted New Zealand as a study destination through targeted outreach.</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>7 July 2026 at 11:15\u202fam</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/recipients-of-the-2026-new-zealand-china-tripartite-partnership-fund\">Recipients of the 2026 New Zealand \u2013 China Tripartite Partnership Fund</a></h4>\n        <p>Education New Zealand Manapou ki te Ao (ENZ) is pleased to announce the recipients of the 2026 Tripartite Partnership Fund.</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>25 June 2026 at 11:41\u202fam</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/around-the-world-in-five-129\">Around the world in five\u202f </a></h4>\n        <p>Education news stories from around the world.\u202f\u202f\u202f\u202f\u202f </p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>25 June 2026 at 11:04\u202fam</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/from-the-acting-chief-executive-continuing-our-work-together\">From the Acting Chief Executive: Continuing our work together</a></h4>\n        <p>As I pass the r\u0101kau to Chief Executive David Downs, I want to share that it has been an absolute privilege to support the sector through this important period..</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>24 June 2026 at 2:17\u202fpm</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/china-transnational-education-policy-update-what-it-means-for-new-zealand-education-providers\">China transnational education policy update: What it means for New Zealand education providers </a></h4>\n        <p>China\u2019s latest policy briefing signals long-term continuity and stability for transnational education (TNE)</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>19 June 2026 at 3:42\u202fpm</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/enz-strengthens-english-language-sector-connections-across-south-america\">ENZ strengthens English language sector connections across South America</a></h4>\n        <p>ENZ has strengthened connections with education agents and prospective students across South America through a targeted English language sector roadshow</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>19 June 2026 at 3:29\u202fpm</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/japanese-education-agents-experience-new-zealands-school-education-offering-firsthand\">Japanese education agents experience New Zealand\u2019s school education offering firsthand</a></h4>\n        <p>Nine Japanese education agents visited New Zealand in May, gaining first-hand insight into the country\u2019s school sector through a coordinated famil programme</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>19 June 2026 at 3:19\u202fpm</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/34-vietnamese-students-awarded-new-zealand-schools-scholarships-as-programme-reaches-record-demand\">34 Vietnamese students awarded New Zealand Schools Scholarships as programme reaches record demand </a></h4>\n        <p>Thirty-four Vietnamese students will begin their secondary education in New Zealand in 2026 after receiving scholarships through the NZSS</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n        <p>16 June 2026 at 10:09\u202fam</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\" data-last-item=\"10\">\n        \n            <p class=\"type\">\n                \n                    Education News\n                \n            </p>\n        \n        <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/aotearoa-new-zealand-reinforces-strong-presence-at-nafsa-2026\">Aotearoa New Zealand reinforces strong presence at NAFSA 2026</a></h4>\n        <p>A strong New Zealand presence was on show at NAFSA 2026 in Orlando, with ENZ and all eight universities coming together under the \u2018Global by Design\u2019 theme</p>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n\n<div class=\"row news-teaser article-load-more\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-10 news-teaser-button\">\n        <span data-url=\"/news-and-research?start=10\" class=\"btn btn-default more-articles\">Load more</span>\n    </div>\n</div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n\n\n    </div><!-- end container -->\n</div><!-- end teasers-wrapper -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"newsletter-signup\">\n    <div class=\"updates-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"row updates\">\n                <div class=\"col-sm-5 col-lg-4\">\n                    <label for=\"signup\">Sign up to receive E-news updates</label>\n                    <p><a href=\"home/e-news-whats-in-it-for-me\">What's in it for me?</a></p>\n                </div><!-- end col -->\n\n                <div class=\"col-sm-7 col-md-5\">\n                    <div class=\"updates-box\">\n                        <div class=\"updates-box-field\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"signup\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address\" name=\"email\" />\n                            <span class=\"help-block email-help hidden\">Please enter a valid email address</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"/news-and-research#\" class=\"btn btn-default chevron signup-next\">Next</a>\n                </div><!-- end col -->\n            </div><!-- end row -->\n        </div><!-- end container -->\n    </div><!-- end upda